================ cublaslt_epilogue_support_probe ================
device         : NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3 (cc 9.0)
what this is   : cuBLASLt's OWN answer, per epilogue x output dtype, to "can you fuse this".
                 No GEMM is launched -- each cell is one FusedLtPlan::new, i.e. descriptors plus
                 one heuristic query. A NOT_SUPPORTED is the FINDING, not a failure.
why it matters : Wave-4 targets #2 and #3 are claims of ABSENCE (no SiLU, no residual+act, no
                 low-precision-output-PLUS-activation member). A header enumerates what the enum
                 has; only this says what the heuristic will dispatch on THIS device.

